WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:05.050
The year 2020 might feel far away right now,
but that hasn't stopped Hollywood's major

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:09.530
studios from lining up a slew of projects
to compete for your movie budget, even a couple

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:10.220
years out.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:14.700
Some of the upcoming releases on the calendar
are highly anticipated sequels, but that isn't

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:19.880
all we're expecting to see; the studios have
also set up new adaptations of existing properties

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:24.660
and all manner of would-be blockbusters, making
for what should be an epic year at the movies.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:29.240
Start marking your calendar now, we've rounded
up an in-depth look at the biggest releases

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:30.580
coming along in 2020.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:32.460
Bad Boys For Life

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:38.160
Seventeen years after the release of Bad Boys
2, audiences will finally get another entry

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:39.440
in the buddy cop franchise.

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:43.840
The film brings back Will Smith and Martin
Lawrence as Miami detectives Mike Lowrey and

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:47.820
Marcus Burnett, and the two couldn't be more
excited about working together again.

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:48.880
"I love that dude.

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:50.180
"He's a great guy."

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:52.600
"That's one of the best times I've had making
movies."

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:53.460
"I love Will."

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:54.540
"Damn come on Martin!"

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:57.160
"And Will loves me so we gonna do it."

00:00:57.380 --> 00:01:01.040
While it's been a bumpy road to get the film
to the green light, it's full speed ahead

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:04.840
for the duo now, and a release date has been
set for January 17th.

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:05.900
G.I.

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:07.180
Joe: Ever Vigilant

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:09.690
Seven years after G.I.

00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:14.880
Joe: Retaliation, everyone's favorite action
figure-based franchise is set to return.

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:20.080
It's unclear which, if any, of the original
movies' stars will return, as it's rumored

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:20.860
to be a reboot.

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:25.620
But considering the original cast included
everyone from Channing Tatum to Bruce Willis

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:29.880
to Dwayne "The Rock" Johnson, it's hard to
imagine we wouldn't see at least some of those

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:34.000
A-listers on the call sheet when movie three
gets ready for a March 27th debut.

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:36.440
Fast &amp; Furious 9

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:42.020
By the time Fast and Furious 9 comes along,
fans of the speedy franchise will have gotten

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:45.520
their first spin-off, featuring Dwayne Johnson
and Jason Statham.

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:50.950
Although we don't know much about where the
saga's headed next, the pressure to keep upping

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:55.800
the stakes should mean it'll find a way to
be even more epic than previous installments.

00:01:56.040 --> 00:02:00.180
With Charlize Theron's Cipher still alive
and on the loose at the end of Fate of the

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:03.060
Furious, there are lots of opportunities for
mayhem.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:07.980
You can probably count on most of your favorite
cast members returning, and the franchise's

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:12.290
ever-increasing profile means there's always
the chance they'll land even more big names

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:13.240
to join the family.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:17.360
Audiences will definitely want to drive out
to the theater on April 10th.

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:19.520
Godzilla vs. Kong

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:24.680
Film fans will finally get the answer to the
age-old question of which movie monster reigns

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:28.560
supreme when Godzilla and King Kong face off
on the big screen.

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:33.300
Director Adam Wingard has already assured
fans that his take on the two monsters will

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:38.870
crown a definitive winner, unlike the 1962
film that first put the two characters against

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:39.370
each other.

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:43.640
Although we still don't know which actors
will be part of the fun, there are sure to

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:48.239
be some A-listers on board when this epic
behemoth battle barrels into the summer box

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:49.600
office on May 22nd.

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:52.140
The Six Billion Dollar Man

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:57.250
Mark Wahlberg will help breathe cinematic
life into the '70s small screen series The

00:02:57.250 --> 00:03:02.660
Six Million Dollar Man by giving the character
a raise to the Six BILLION Dollar Man.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:07.519
Wahlberg will play Steve Austin, a former
astronaut who uses cutting-edge technology

00:03:07.519 --> 00:03:13.180
to become half-machine in order to survive
after an accident, and uses his newfound superhuman

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:17.560
strength to work as a secret agent working
for the Office of Scientific Intelligence.

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:23.140
With its mix of robotics, espionage, and brute
physical force, The Six Billion Dollar Man

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:25.960
should be an event when it comes along on
June 5th.

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:27.260
Red Notice

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:33.120
Dwayne Johnson is set to re-team with director
Rawson Marshall Thurber, after working together

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:38.620
on Central Intelligence and Skyscraper, for
2020's action-comedy film Red Notice.

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:43.580
The movie will feature Johnson as an Interpol
agent chasing after the most wanted art thief

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:44.320
in the world.

00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:48.260
We'll see if The Rock maintains his magic
streak at the movies when Red Notice hits

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:49.740
theaters on June 12th.

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:52.140
Indiana Jones 5

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:57.360
This installment of the Indiana Jones films
won't feature any lead-lined refrigerators

00:03:57.379 --> 00:04:02.739
or ill-explained aliens, so if you weren't
a fan of Kingdom of the Crystal Skull, the

00:04:02.740 --> 00:04:05.140
franchise's newest outing will get things
back on track for you.

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:09.680
Everyone involved seems to think the movie
will be a course correction, with Harrison

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:14.730
Ford saying he only wanted to return if the
script was great, and Steven Spielberg saying

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:18.040
he thinks the movie is, quote "straight down
the pike for the fans."

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:20.320
"It's great fun to play this character.

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:22.360
It's great fun to work with Steven.

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:23.280
I'm looking forward to it."

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:27.540
There's a lot of potential for the future
of the franchise, and the next film seems

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:32.240
like it could bring back the adventure of
the original trilogy when it arrives on July

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:32.740
10th.

00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:34.440
Bios

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:38.380
Tom Hanks will be the last man on Earth in
this sci-fi outing.

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:44.420
Specific plot details for Bios are being kept
tightly under wraps, but we do know that Hanks'

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:49.199
character, Finch, is an ailing inventor and
the last man left on this planet, who builds

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:52.140
a robot to protect his beloved dog after his
death.

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:56.619
Although we don't have many concrete details
yet, Hanks has shown us many, many times that

00:04:56.619 --> 00:05:01.659
he's the right guy to lead up any kind of
survival story, even completely solo, so count

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:04.000
on this one to be a must-watch on October
2nd.

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:07.340
Fantastic Beasts 3

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:12.300
While we're still waiting to see what happens
in the second Fantastic Beasts and Where to

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:16.720
Find Them movie, Warner Bros. is already gearing
up for the third film in the franchise.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:21.110
Very little is known about the film at this
point, but the series definitely got off to

00:05:21.110 --> 00:05:25.640
an encouraging start, with the first film
earning solid reviews and healthy box office

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:26.140
returns.

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:31.160
With the second movie bringing in even more
Harry Potter connections and the third likely

00:05:31.169 --> 00:05:35.809
to build on that further, November 20th is
a date you'll want to pencil in on your calendar

00:05:35.809 --> 00:05:37.500
for more movie magic to come.

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:39.220
Avatar 2

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:45.060
We're getting four Avatar sequels over the
next decade, so a lot rides on the first one

00:05:45.060 --> 00:05:47.320
doing well when it hits theaters in 2020.

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:53.920
James Cameron's massive undertaking reportedly
has a total budget of over $1 billion, allowing

00:05:53.930 --> 00:05:58.589
the director to fully embrace new technology
and make sure that the sequels are as visually

00:05:58.589 --> 00:05:59.720
stunning as the first chapter.

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:04.980
The movies are said to be a family saga about
Jake, Neytiri, and their children, with many

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:07.780
of the film's original cast returning as well.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:13.460
Newcomers to the franchise include Cliff Curtis
and Oona Chaplin as additions to the Pandora

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:16.360
collective, which will return to theaters
December 18th.

00:06:17.260 --> 00:06:18.600
Sherlock Holmes 3

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:24.800
Robert Downey Jr. is set to return for a third
outing as the world's most famous detective

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:29.240
in a film that will also feature the return
of his co-star Jude Law as John Watson.

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:33.979
It's unclear if Guy Ritchie, who directed
the first two films, will return, but since

00:06:33.979 --> 00:06:38.930
it's been nine years since Downey last played
the character in A Game of Shadows, it should

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:43.490
be interesting to see how his take on Sherlock
Holmes has aged when this new leg of the adventure

00:06:43.490 --> 00:06:45.160
hits theaters December 25th.

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:48.000
Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 3

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:54.140
Last but certainly not least, Marvel is expected
to bring back their intergalactic team of

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:57.320
misfits with Guardians of the Galaxy Vol.
3.

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:02.320
It's unclear who will return following the
events of Avengers: Infinity War, but we do

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:07.809
know it's supposed to offer an "epic conclusion"
to the saga of the Star-Lord's ragtag squadron

00:07:07.809 --> 00:07:12.430
while helping to potentially launch the next
phase of the Marvel Cinematic Universe.

